der `validation04-full-evidence/`. It retains numerical rows, conditional payloads and arrays outside Git. SHA-256:\n\n`7f90578b56dcdf26f3537beef5574e814ae5f909cf56194943db33e36803208e`\n\nThe source and archive member bytes were verified against the full publication manifest. Prior deployment/numerical failures and the exact-input profile diagnostic remain preserved. New shifted-cut diagnostics and multi-day preparation have separate provenance; they are not inferred from this validation archive.\n\nSee [PR #5](https://github.com/FlorianPfaff/orbit-smoothing-poc/pull/5) and `validation/segmented-v4/validation04/index.html` for the report.\n"}